    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "reasoning": "The learner has identified the change in total resistance. Next, connect the larger denominator to the current.",
      "content": "Yes, exactly. With the emf fixed, \(I=\\frac{\\varepsilon}{R+r}\). If the denominator gets bigger, what happens to the current—and therefore the ammeter reading?"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The current decreases?"
